# A check that compared nothing must not pass
law gate_compares_nonzero
kind audit
claim a check reports how many items it compared, how many of them mismatched outside the known list, and the known list
claim comparing zero items is a failure of the check, not a pass
source ALICE-Physics scripts/docs_lint.py:33 (every check must compare at least one item), :268 (compared nothing is an error)

input compared 1
input mismatches 1
x-input known-mismatches list of text      # the known case names

begin audit
audit gate-compares-nonzero
evidence compared
expect mismatches == 0
range known-mismatches case-17 case-42
end audit

verdict the verdict of the audit block for the given measurements
